invariant: INV-14
file: srv_cookie.c
catches: srv_flight_test_aes
reason: srv_cookie_open knows ChaCha20 alone again, which is what the first
  SUITE=aesgcm server shipped. That server selects AES-GCM for a client
  that offers no ChaCha20 and mints a cookie naming it, then refuses its
  own cookie when the second ClientHello echoes it, so every such client
  that sent no key share fails with illegal_parameter.
  test_flight_retry_suite runs that retry, and
  test_flight_cookie_suite_length opens an AES-GCM cookie at its exact
  length.

--- old
    size_t body_hash_len = suite_hash_len(body_suite);
--- new
    size_t body_hash_len = body_suite == SUITE_CHACHA20_POLY1305_SHA256 ? SHA256_LEN : 0;
